  hook={Learn a NeRF and the camera itself — lens distortion included — without COLMAP.},
  problem={NeRF needs accurate camera poses and intrinsics, usually from COLMAP, and real lenses add non-linear distortions that simple camera models miss.},
  idea={Jointly learn the scene and a generic camera model (pinhole, fourth-order radial distortion and a learnable noise model) using photometric consistency plus a new projected ray distance loss.},
  result={Learns intrinsics and poses from scratch without COLMAP initialization and improves PSNR over baselines; it plugs into other NeRF variants.},
  my_role={First author of the first pose-free NeRF optimization pipeline; I also led the open-source project.}
